# Preserve existing comments

When you edit a file, leave every comment that is already in it unchanged.

- Do not delete, rewrite, reword, reformat, or move an existing comment.
- Do not clean up comments while changing nearby code.
- Comments you add in the same edit are fine. Leave prior comments exactly as written.

```python
# ❌ BAD — existing comment rewritten while changing the call
# Fetch the user record from the cache
user = cache.get(user_id)

# ✅ GOOD — existing comment left character for character
# grab user from redis
user = cache.get(user_id)
```
